-- ============================================================================
-- PassGo — seed data (50 countries + Kenyan (KE) passport visa rules)
-- Run AFTER schema.sql. Idempotent via ON CONFLICT.
-- Image URLs use picsum.photos placeholders — replace with real assets later.
-- Visa data is INDICATIVE for demo purposes; the official_link is authoritative.
-- ============================================================================

-- ── COUNTRIES (1–24: full detail, mirror src/data/mockCountries.ts) ──────────
on conflict (id) do nothing;

-- ── COUNTRIES (25–50: compact, to reach 50 popular destinations) ─────────────
on conflict (id) do nothing;

-- ── VISA RULES for the KENYAN (KE) passport — all 50 destinations ────────────
on conflict (passport_country, dest_country) do nothing;

-- ── CITIES (flagship destinations) ───────────────────────────────────────────
on conflict (id) do nothing;

-- ── ATTRACTIONS (subset; mirror src/data/mockAttractions.ts) ─────────────────
on conflict (id) do nothing;

